# MailCraft ribbon definitions: main window, Mail module (plus the Search contextual tab).
#
# Behaviour, group/control order, feature names and keytips follow plan/outlook/ribbon-mail.md, search.md and
# responsive.md; icons and wording beyond feature names are our own. Grammar (see ribbon/defs.rs):
#
#   surface <name>                      main | search | compose | read | calendar | people | tasks | notes
#   mode simplified|classic|both
#   tab <Name> | <keytip> | <opts>      opts: more=<menu> (the "…" menu, Simplified)
#   group <Name> | <keytip> | <opts>    opts: s<W>=<act> c<W>=<act> (width rules), icon=, launch=<cmd>{json}, rows
#   <kind> <size> | <label> | <icon> | <cmd> | <params> | <keytip> | <opts>
#        kind: button split drop toggle check gallery combo edit;  size: L large, S small, I small icon-only
#        opts: menu=<name> on=<state> dyn=<source> w=<px> s<W>=<act> c<W>=<act>
#   br                                  next row (groups with the `rows` option, Classic)
#   menu <name>                         then: item | label | icon | cmd | params | keytip | opts
#                                             sub | label | icon | <menu> | | keytip
#                                             dyn | <source> | cmd | params template
#                                             sep
#
# Width rules apply when the effective window width is at or below W. Simplified actions: nolabel, nolabel1
# (all but the first control lose labels), narrow (galleries), overflow (into the "…" menu). Classic actions:
# nolabel (small buttons lose labels), small (large → small), iconly (everything icon-only), narrow (galleries
# show one column), collapse (the group becomes one dropdown button).

surface main
mode simplified

tab Home | H | more=moreHome
group New | ZW
split S | New Email | new-mail | mail.newEmail | | N | menu=newItems
group Move & Delete | ZA | s1366=nolabel1
split S | Delete | delete | mail.delete | | D | menu=deleteMore
button S | Archive... | archive | mail.archive | | O
drop S | Move | move | | | MV | menu=move s400=overflow
group Report | R | s1280=nolabel s900=overflow
split S | Report | junk | mail.report | {"kind":"junk"} | R1 | menu=report
group Respond | ZR | s1280=nolabel
button S | Reply | reply | mail.reply | | RP
button S | Reply All | reply-all | mail.replyAll | | RA
button S | Forward | forward | mail.forward | | FW
group Quick Steps | ZQ | s1600=narrow s1024=overflow
gallery S | Quick Steps | quick-steps | | | QS | dyn=quicksteps menu=quickSteps w=359
group Tags | ZT | s600=overflow
button S | Unread/Read | envelope-open | mail.toggleRead | | W
drop I | Categorize | categorize | | | G | menu=categorize s700=overflow
drop I | Follow Up | flag | | | U | menu=followUp s700=overflow
group Find | ZN | s900=overflow
edit S | Search People | address-book | people.search | {"text":"$value"} | FC | w=130
button I | Address Book... | address-book | compose.addressBook | | AB
drop I | Filter Email | filter | | | L | menu=filterEmail
group Speech | Z4 | s1366=overflow
button S | Read Aloud | conversation | review.readAloud | | R2

tab Send / Receive | JS | more=moreSendReceive
group Send & Receive | ZS
button S | Send/Receive All Folders | sync | sendReceive.all | | S
button S | Send All | send | sendReceive.sendAll | | A
button S | Update Folder | folder-open | sendReceive.folder | | D
drop S | Send/Receive Groups | sync | | | G | menu=sendReceiveGroups
group Download | ZD
button S | Show Progress... | info | sendReceive.showProgress | | P
button S | Cancel All | close | sendReceive.cancelAll | | C
group Preferences | ZP
toggle S | Work Offline | warning | sendReceive.workOffline | {"offline":"$on"} | W | on=mem:offline

tab View | V | more=moreView
group Focused Inbox | C
toggle S | Show Focused Inbox | inbox | view.focusedInbox | | W | on=focused
group Current View | ZV
drop S | Change View | view | | | CV | menu=changeView
drop S | Current View | conversation | | | Y1 | menu=currentView
group Arrangement | ZM
drop S | Arrange By | sort | | | AB | menu=arrangeBy
toggle S | Reverse Sort | sort-up | view.reverseSort | | RS | on=reverse
group Layout | ZS
toggle S | Use Tighter Spacing | view | view.tighterSpacing | | U | on=tighter
drop S | Layout | reading-pane | | | Y2 | menu=layout

tab Help | E | more=moreHelp
group Help | H
button S | Help | help | help.help | | H
button S | Contact Support... | person | help.contactSupport | | C
button S | Feedback | email | help.feedback | | F
button S | Suggest a Feature | info | help.feedback | {"kind":"suggestion"} | S1
button S | Show Training | today | help.showTraining | | S2
button S | What's New | bell | help.whatsNew | | W

